{"id":"5209a246ccd7818e","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-pa-binary-dnc.md","title":"PA度与二值DNC函数","display":"thm-pa-binary-dnc — PA度与二值DNC函数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-pa-binary-dnc","aliases":["43-thm-pa-binary-dnc"],"display":"thm-pa-binary-dnc — PA度与二值DNC函数","depends_on":["[[43-df-pa-degree]]","[[43-df-dnc]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Lemma 5.19.2, print pp.73–74 / PDF pp.93–94","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-pa-binary-dnc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-pa-binary-dnc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pa-binary-dnc — PA度与二值DNC函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"15f1f418de3165e2\" href=\"?note=15f1f418de3165e2\" title=\"43-df-pa-degree\">43-df-pa-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"323b0a74dc337ecf\" href=\"?note=323b0a74dc337ecf\" title=\"43-df-dnc\">43-df-dnc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 5.19.2, print pp.73–74 / PDF pp.93–94"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PADegree}\">\\(\\operatorname{PADegree}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}\">\\(\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}\\)</span>、函数归约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"15f1f418de3165e2\" href=\"?note=15f1f418de3165e2\" title=\"43-df-pa-degree\">43-df-pa-degree</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"323b0a74dc337ecf\" href=\"?note=323b0a74dc337ecf\" title=\"43-df-dnc\">43-df-dnc</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PADegree}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(f\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}(f)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PADegree}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(f\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}(f)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>二值DNC函数构成非空有效闭类；反向用二值对角回避在任意给定非空可判定树的分叉处选择仍可延伸的方向。来源给出对应引理。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 5.19.2, print pp.73–74 / PDF pp.93–94。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-pa-degree","status":"resolved","id":"15f1f418de3165e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pa-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"323b0a74dc337ecf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dnc]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pa-degree","status":"resolved","id":"15f1f418de3165e2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PADegree}$、$\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-pa-degree]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"323b0a74dc337ecf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PADegree}$、$\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-pa-degree]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PADegree}$、$\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}$、函数归约 $\\le_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-pa-degree]]、[[43-df-dnc]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PADegree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PADegree}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(f\\le_TA\\land\\operatorname{BinaryDNC}(f)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1196,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-pa-binary-dnc]] — PA度与二值DNC函数"}],"outgoing":["15f1f418de3165e2","323b0a74dc337ecf","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}